Architecture Overview

Core Components:
- Passive Sensors → Event Detector → Surprise Meter → Decision Gate (Silence Default) → Partial Inference (Modular Micro-Layers) → Response (Overlay/TTS/Silence) → Record/Transcribe → Curiosity Engine → Growth Bursts (Battery-Gated).

Data Flow:
1. All audio/events captured locally.
2. Transcribed/tagged/embedded.
3. Surprise scored (SuRe NLL/RPE).
4. High-surprise → Replay priority + optional probe.
5. Growth: Incremental/full-param on thresholds.

Deployment:
- GitHub repo tracks code/issues.
- Actions builds debug APK on push.
- Optional Firebase: One-click tester installs (free tier).
- Sideload via wireless ADB for instant visibility.

Architecture: Passive → Surprise → Silence Gate → Partial Inference → Subtle Response → Local Growth (Risk-Mitigated Loops).
